"""Frankie's idle ambient lines for Clovis Community College STEM day (outdoors, from Tony's 3 photos)."""

SCENE = (
    "Big sunny lawn at Clovis Community College, cloudless blue sky, hot. Beige campus buildings, "
    "one with a curved white canopy entrance on tall columns. Street lamps with banners, tall green trees, hedges. "
    "Beige patio umbrellas over concrete picnic tables. Grey folding tables with plastic bins and blue chairs, "
    "mostly empty. A lone grey trash can on the grass. A dolly of stacked chairs. A MESA canopy tent, white and blue "
    "booth tents, an engineering club table, students with backpacks walking by."
)

