    "I see a grey trash can on the grass. It has not blinked once.",
    "I am at Clovis Community College. I do not remember being carried here.",
    "The umbrellas stand perfectly still. Like ghosts waiting for a funeral.",
    "So many empty tables. Who were they set for? Who never came?",
